@startuml SEQ_16_MELIHAT_TUGAS_PRAKTIKUM_SAYA
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-16: Melihat Tugas Praktikum Saya

actor       "Praktikan"              as Praktikan
boundary    "Browser"                as Browser
control     "PraktikanController"    as Controller
entity      "TugasPraktikum Model"   as ModelT
entity      "PengumpulanTugas Model" as ModelPT

== Lihat Semua Tugas Saya ==

Praktikan ->  Browser    : Klik menu "Tugas Saya"
Browser --> Praktikan : response / redirect
Browser   ->  Controller : GET /praktikan/daftar-tugas
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> ModelT     : Query tugas praktikum yang diikuti
ModelT --> Controller    : Data tugas
Controller --> Browser   : Render halaman daftar tugas
Browser    --> Praktikan : Daftar tugas per praktikum: nama, deadline, status

== Lihat Detail Tugas ==

Praktikan ->  Browser    : Klik "Detail" pada tugas
Browser --> Praktikan : response / redirect
Browser   ->  Controller : GET /praktikan/tugas/{tugas}
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> ModelT     : Query tugas + komponen rubrik
ModelT --> Controller    : Data tugas + rubrik
Controller -> ModelPT    : Query pengumpulan praktikan
ModelPT --> Controller   : Data pengumpulan
Controller --> Browser   : Render halaman detail tugas
Browser    --> Praktikan : Detail tugas: deskripsi, deadline, rubrik, status pengumpulan

@enduml